An interactive map: zoom, drag, filters, fullscreen and markers with popups. Put Map marker lines inside it.

<pre>
{{Map|image=map_shard1.png|title=Shard 1|
{{Map marker|chest|52.5|51.5}}
{{Map marker|boss|7|12.5|name=Ogre King|text=Drops the Ogre Club.}}
}}
</pre>

Part of the [[Project:Design kit|design kit]]. Marker types are listed in [[Module:Map/types]].

